---
// About section component
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Left side with content -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">
          About the Cooperative AI South Africa Fellowship
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700">
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
            The Cooperative AI South Africa Fellowship is a prestigious 6-month research program designed to advance the field of cooperative artificial intelligence. 
            Fellows will work on cutting-edge research projects focused on multi-agent cooperation, fairness, and transparency in AI systems.
          </p>
          
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Based in Cape Town, South Africa, this fellowship brings together researchers from around the world to collaborate on solving some of the most 
            pressing challenges in AI cooperation. The program provides comprehensive support including mentorship, accommodation, and visa assistance.
          </p>
          
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Our research spans multiple domains including AI for democracy, multi-agent security, cultural cooperation, and debiasing cooperative systems. 
            Fellows will have the opportunity to publish their work and contribute to the global AI safety community.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Right side with background -->
      <div class="bg-yellow-50 h-96 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-orange-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium">Research & Innovation</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Apply button centered at bottom -->
    <div class="text-center mt-12">
      <a href="#apply" class="inline-block bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-md text-lg font-semibold transition-colors duration-200">
        APPLY NOW
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
